WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
OPENING

00:06.630 --> 00:08.230
Sana...

00:09.040 --> 00:11.840
Wataru? Hiroki?

00:13.040 --> 00:18.840
It's painful, Sana... It's painful and scary...

00:19.510 --> 00:24.880
Akira? Where? Where are you all? All of you...

00:27.560 --> 00:40.930
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

00:27.560 --> 00:34.170
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

00:34.170 --> 00:40.940
Take flight on wings

00:55.280 --> 00:58.450
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

00:55.290 --> 00:58.460
Like fragile but bitter fruit

00:58.450 --> 01:01.660
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

00:58.460 --> 01:01.670
It fascinates people's hearts

01:01.660 --> 01:04.760
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

01:01.670 --> 01:03.170
The shadow that manipulates

01:03.170 --> 01:04.770
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

01:04.760 --> 01:07.930
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

01:04.770 --> 01:07.940
Smells of blood

01:07.930 --> 01:20.930
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

01:07.940 --> 01:14.380
The whisper of Death

01:14.380 --> 01:20.940
That awakens fading heartbeats

01:21.910 --> 01:28.280
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

01:21.920 --> 01:28.290
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:28.280 --> 01:34.520
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

01:28.290 --> 01:34.530
Silver wings take flight

01:34.520 --> 01:41.000
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

01:34.530 --> 01:41.000
Become the power that tears at deep winds

01:41.000 --> 01:50.730
Kirisaku chikara to nare

01:41.000 --> 01:50.740
With poised claws

01:51.720 --> 01:54.910
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

01:57.550 --> 02:02.010
Episode 12
The World

02:03.050 --> 02:07.320
I didn't lie when I said my aim
was to avenge my dad.

02:07.520 --> 02:09.360
Up to a point.

02:09.360 --> 02:12.030
Back in those days,
I did not have a doubt in my mind,

02:12.030 --> 02:15.150
and dreamed of a future on the side
of the authorities.

02:15.360 --> 02:19.600
Whether I would've become a great leader
like my dad is a different story.

02:20.070 --> 02:23.730
Then, when my dad fell from power,
my dreams crumbled overnight.

02:32.480 --> 02:37.590
After losing his backing, I kept looking
for a bridge to power.

02:37.590 --> 02:41.650
The straw I managed to grab on to was Phantom.

02:44.260 --> 02:49.960
I knew well how high a hill I would have to crawl up.

02:50.130 --> 02:56.440
That's why I used revenge for my father
as motivation, for a while.

02:56.440 --> 03:00.210
But you know, something made up
like that, easily crumbles.

03:00.210 --> 03:02.870
Why were you so set on something like that?

03:03.210 --> 03:08.240
"Something like that"?
Do you mean my desire for power?

03:09.350 --> 03:12.590
I suppose you would consider it unimportant.

03:12.590 --> 03:18.490
But, sadly, that is what my ego
depended on, for the most part.

03:18.490 --> 03:24.400
And I was made aware of this over
and over... after I had lost it all.

03:24.600 --> 03:28.090
That's when I met you.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.870
Uh, sorry...

03:40.750 --> 03:42.720
I got the chills.

03:42.720 --> 03:46.090
It wasn't me you were looking at.

03:46.090 --> 03:49.660
Not the scenery or this world...

03:49.660 --> 03:52.230
You weren't even seeing yourself.

03:52.230 --> 03:55.600
For the first time, I'd met someone
who had no "self,"

03:55.600 --> 03:58.570
and for some reason, I hated you.

03:58.900 --> 04:00.170
Hated me?

04:00.170 --> 04:04.140
Well, of course. Don't you think it was unfair?

04:04.140 --> 04:07.840
Everyone else was suffering because of their ego.

04:09.310 --> 04:15.870
Maybe, Joe, I acted as I did because
I wanted to see you gain an ego.

04:18.150 --> 04:22.490
I'm happy, Joe... that you've changed.
That's why...

04:22.490 --> 04:23.890
Come, Joe!

04:23.890 --> 04:25.790
Now that you've awakened to your ego,

04:25.790 --> 04:29.130
you shouldn't be able to escape
the spell of the Gladiator!

04:33.870 --> 04:36.200
Commander, word from the control room.

04:36.200 --> 04:39.170
They have caught sight of a large number
of enemies headed this way.

04:39.170 --> 04:40.740
I know.

04:40.310 --> 04:41.140
What?

04:40.880 --> 04:44.550
I figured Shiba would lead Satsuma here.

04:44.550 --> 04:46.080
The army has their orders.

04:46.080 --> 04:48.050
But they're coming by air and sea!

05:03.830 --> 05:06.600
All right, guys! Get your asses in gear!

05:06.600 --> 05:08.190
Aye, suh!

05:25.790 --> 05:26.980
That day...

05:30.220 --> 05:32.250
Is that the strength he showed that day?

05:35.730 --> 05:36.960
Begin attack!

05:38.400 --> 05:39.700
Missiles approaching!

05:39.700 --> 05:42.530
Deploy chaff! Fire interceptor missiles!

05:55.450 --> 05:59.750
Twenty meters should do it.
Ascend as soon as we get off.

06:00.760 --> 06:01.520
Huh?

06:01.690 --> 06:02.860
Renée...

06:02.860 --> 06:07.190
Things have changed since you were there.
You'll need a guide, right?

06:08.760 --> 06:10.130
Whatever you want.

06:10.130 --> 06:12.730
We must cover Captain Shiba! Fire!

06:20.310 --> 06:21.240
Let's go!

06:32.850 --> 06:35.290
Joe, you can't defeat me.

06:35.490 --> 06:36.420
What?

06:45.670 --> 06:47.960
Jin... you...

06:48.900 --> 06:51.110
I disarmed my limiter.

06:51.110 --> 06:52.440
Don't do it, Jin!

06:52.440 --> 06:56.540
If you can withstand it, there's no reason I can't!

06:57.040 --> 07:00.310
I cannot lose to you, Joe.

07:00.310 --> 07:03.480
Not... Not to someone who has nothing!

07:08.890 --> 07:11.060
Renée, where are the Gladiators?

07:11.060 --> 07:12.490
You're thinking of using one?

07:40.050 --> 07:41.080
Jin!

07:43.690 --> 07:47.020
Tsurusawa is beginning to give way to fear.

07:52.030 --> 07:52.760
Damn!

07:58.570 --> 08:00.440
Toraji! This way!

08:09.920 --> 08:13.550
The only one left is this one
that was used as a simulator.

08:13.550 --> 08:15.990
I don't know if it'll work properly.

08:16.760 --> 08:17.260
TORA

08:18.030 --> 08:21.520
What a coincidence... It's the one I used to wear.

08:25.170 --> 08:27.240
Why? Why?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.360
Why, Joe?

08:29.700 --> 08:36.840
Weren't you able to put on the Gladiator suit
because you were too empty to even feel the terror?

08:47.120 --> 08:48.180
Jin!

08:49.060 --> 08:50.550
Jin! Get out!

09:26.590 --> 09:29.530
Damn! Their armor has been strengthened.

09:40.310 --> 09:42.610
That's it for you, Tsurusawa.

09:42.610 --> 09:43.910
Commander!

09:43.910 --> 09:45.610
The Gladiator...

09:47.920 --> 09:51.720
He's started up the simulator suit,
and is coming this way.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.950
Shiba, huh?

09:55.060 --> 09:57.580
Looks like it's time to use that thing.

09:59.660 --> 10:00.680
Huh?

10:05.670 --> 10:07.330
You traitors!

10:08.100 --> 10:09.570
Drake?

10:09.570 --> 10:10.830
Is that you, Drake?!

10:17.880 --> 10:18.900
Jin...

10:29.690 --> 10:31.210
Joe...

10:31.890 --> 10:34.960
Why, Joe?

10:34.960 --> 10:38.860
How am I different from you?

10:39.030 --> 10:40.360
Jin...

10:40.640 --> 10:45.230
Am I... like you... that day?

10:48.280 --> 10:53.580
Or... am I... different?

11:08.330 --> 11:09.350
Jin!

11:15.600 --> 11:18.230
Jin! Pull yourself together!

11:20.980 --> 11:23.000
Jin! Jin!

11:33.120 --> 11:34.550
Joe...

11:35.090 --> 11:36.450
Jin!

11:58.010 --> 12:00.980
Have you come to defeat me, Shiba?

12:00.980 --> 12:05.420
Not just you. This whole rotten operation!

12:05.420 --> 12:10.190
I hear the rebels in this area
have dared to begin acting up.

12:10.460 --> 12:13.790
You have the nerve to stir them up.

12:15.400 --> 12:21.470
History shows that immoral leaders
are overthrown by the masses.

12:21.470 --> 12:24.270
Resign yourself, Drake!

12:24.940 --> 12:26.800
Don't make me laugh!

12:26.940 --> 12:32.040
It just shows that those without
true power are overthrown.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.550
What?! Aren't they unmanned?

12:38.990 --> 12:40.990
They're being controlled?!

12:40.990 --> 12:42.320
Renée! Step back!

12:43.360 --> 12:47.660
We networked the nervous systems
embedded in these six Gladiators

12:47.660 --> 12:53.500
to control all electronic devices
and weapons that approach.

12:53.700 --> 12:58.430
When this power is optimized,
do you know what becomes possible?

13:00.670 --> 13:04.270
Seems this Gladiator is the exception!

13:08.350 --> 13:12.150
There! That's it! You know, the resi... the residence!

13:12.150 --> 13:14.880
We'll enter Logos over an ill-protected bridge.

13:15.620 --> 13:17.220
Found you at last!

13:17.220 --> 13:19.960
Oh, the lady with the big boobs!

13:19.960 --> 13:21.830
Ouch!

13:21.830 --> 13:23.760
You're going to save Sana, aren't you?

13:23.760 --> 13:25.530
How did you find me?

13:25.530 --> 13:29.590
Anyone listening in to communications
around here could figure it out.

13:29.800 --> 13:32.670
Follow me! I've found the route in.

13:37.240 --> 13:39.300
You impress me, Shiba.

13:40.080 --> 13:44.650
To have such a strong will, and to come
this far fighting in a Gladiator suit...

13:44.650 --> 13:46.550
It's such a shame...

13:49.320 --> 13:50.650
Stop that, Renée!

13:51.560 --> 13:52.690
Toraji!

13:53.860 --> 13:56.990
I guess you were just another woman, after all.

13:57.870 --> 14:01.630
Hurry up and let him out,
before he goes crazy and dies.

14:26.230 --> 14:27.520
My controls are lost!

14:43.780 --> 14:46.040
W-What's going on?

14:47.350 --> 14:48.580
What happened?

14:48.580 --> 14:50.320
I-I don't know.

14:50.320 --> 14:52.790
We're being controlled by something.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.950
What the heck's happening?

14:59.130 --> 15:00.490
A G-Gladiator?!

15:00.660 --> 15:01.720
What is it?!

15:03.330 --> 15:06.770
A torpedo has been fired
from one of our submarines!

15:06.770 --> 15:08.030
What?

15:08.970 --> 15:10.870
The missiles are firing on their own!

15:13.370 --> 15:15.210
What in the world?!

15:15.210 --> 15:19.280
Order all of our ships to turn off
all electronics and steer by sight.

15:19.280 --> 15:20.410
Yes, sir!

15:26.090 --> 15:29.150
What... What's going on?

15:29.720 --> 15:31.760
An enormous power...

15:31.760 --> 15:35.890
The Gladiators' ultimate form is a mobile fort.

15:37.400 --> 15:40.970
All modern weapons use electronics
in one form or another.

15:40.970 --> 15:44.310
Get too close and they will be taken over.

15:44.310 --> 15:46.470
We can only fight with analog weapons.

15:46.910 --> 15:50.430
No, maybe with another Gladiator...

15:51.010 --> 15:52.070
Drake!

15:53.550 --> 15:54.740
Why, that's...

15:55.050 --> 15:57.080
Katsuragi...

15:57.080 --> 15:58.320
Sana...

15:58.320 --> 16:00.180
Where did you send Sana?

16:05.460 --> 16:06.620
Joe...

16:07.760 --> 16:09.760
Joe! Is that you, Joe?

16:09.760 --> 16:11.230
I'll leave Sana to you.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.630
Interesting...

16:19.870 --> 16:21.700
So this is what Tsurusawa was talking about...

16:26.710 --> 16:30.150
That thing... It's in there...

16:30.990 --> 16:33.110
I want to save them all.

16:38.190 --> 16:39.520
Sana...

16:46.570 --> 16:47.660
Stop it!

17:01.280 --> 17:02.650
This is the end.

17:05.020 --> 17:10.420
Sana! Sana! I'm scared! Help me!

17:10.720 --> 17:11.750
Wataru?

17:34.420 --> 17:40.190
This Gladiator can take over the controls of any
weapon within a maximum radius of 100km.

17:40.190 --> 17:42.660
No one can touch me now.

17:42.920 --> 17:46.380
Not even if they are from the Freedom States.

17:54.870 --> 17:56.100
Drake?!

17:56.100 --> 17:59.070
Why is this? Why?

17:59.070 --> 18:02.530
I should have cleared all the obstacles...

18:03.580 --> 18:06.050
Is there an overload?!

18:15.890 --> 18:17.650
Why is it moving?

18:38.710 --> 18:42.340
This... This is... power...

18:43.220 --> 18:44.580
Ultimate...

18:55.500 --> 18:56.790
Katsuragi?

19:05.540 --> 19:07.400
Damn! It won't stop!

19:08.540 --> 19:09.770
How can I...

19:19.150 --> 19:20.050
Joe!

19:20.050 --> 19:21.350
Kill him!

19:22.120 --> 19:23.950
They should all die!

19:24.060 --> 19:27.030
Everything should be wiped out.

19:27.490 --> 19:29.590
Destroy! Destroy!

19:29.800 --> 19:31.920
Burn! Burn up!

19:32.200 --> 19:34.100
Yuya! Hiroki!

19:34.300 --> 19:36.390
Kenji! Akira, too!

19:37.070 --> 19:39.370
Kill! Kill them!

19:39.370 --> 19:41.530
Yuya, what's wrong?

19:41.610 --> 19:43.240
Let everything burn up!

19:43.240 --> 19:44.340
Mamoru?!

19:53.320 --> 19:54.620
Wataru...

20:30.190 --> 20:31.450
Sana...

20:42.000 --> 20:43.700
The steering is back!

20:43.700 --> 20:45.170
Is it back to normal?

20:45.340 --> 20:47.200
The attack is over.

20:49.510 --> 20:51.740
We can control the ship again!

20:58.350 --> 20:59.580
Here you go.

21:00.720 --> 21:03.420
Joe... Joe!

21:03.520 --> 21:04.750
Joe!

21:07.760 --> 21:10.820
Sana... You saved me, didn't you?

21:10.900 --> 21:12.830
Joe...

21:30.750 --> 21:34.250
Both Logos and Revinus have been wiped out.

21:34.250 --> 21:37.460
Yeah. But there's no time for us to kick back.

21:37.460 --> 21:39.960
We will begin preparations
for reconstruction right away.

21:39.960 --> 21:44.990
That's good. There's no telling
how Freedom States will respond.

21:45.770 --> 21:48.860
Katsuragi, you'll help us, won't you?

21:51.370 --> 21:52.170
Katsuragi...

21:52.170 --> 21:54.540
Let me take care of Sana.

21:54.880 --> 21:57.210
Don't worry about what will happen next.

22:00.810 --> 22:05.050
I will create the world in my own way.

22:05.750 --> 22:09.310
You should go and walk the world
on your own two feet.

22:13.230 --> 22:15.220
The world...

22:15.700 --> 22:20.070
Someday, somewhere, our paths
could very well cross again.

22:21.740 --> 22:24.700
Please see that Sana is happy.

22:28.910 --> 22:30.840
He does whatever he pleases.

22:32.080 --> 22:37.750
They say the nerve cells in Drake's Gladiators
suffered acute necrosis.

22:38.190 --> 22:41.850
If they had continued as they were,
we could never have won.

22:42.420 --> 22:45.550
I guess it means luck was on our side.

22:45.890 --> 22:49.830
You don't really believe that was all, do you?

22:57.640 --> 23:01.330
Joe, aren't you coming with us, Joe?

23:01.780 --> 23:04.080
No. This is good-bye.

23:04.080 --> 23:06.350
Where are you going, all alone?

23:06.350 --> 23:10.510
Well, I think I'll travel a little and see the world.

23:10.880 --> 23:12.720
I see...

23:14.120 --> 23:15.160
Joe...

23:15.160 --> 23:16.050
Hm?

23:17.260 --> 23:19.920
Thank you, Joe...

23:20.230 --> 23:21.900
Hey, Sana!

23:21.900 --> 23:24.130
What are you dawdling for? We're leaving!

23:24.130 --> 23:25.190
Okay!

23:31.740 --> 23:32.710
Joe!

23:34.210 --> 23:36.730
We'll meet again someday, right?

23:41.250 --> 23:42.550
Yeah...

23:46.550 --> 23:48.110
Count on it.

23:49.900 --> 23:50.690
THE END
